<h3>Threshold four: the file has a keeper</h3>
<p>This is the one that actually costs money. It arrives when the spreadsheet contains logic that only one person understands — a pricing rule buried in a nested IF, a column that must be cleared every Monday, a tab that looks unused but is not.</p>
